@startuml Architecture_ThreeTier
title Bujet — Three-tier client/server architecture (Sprints 1 & 2)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #FDFDFD
  BorderColor #555555
}
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor #FFF5D6
  BorderColor #555555
}
skinparam node {
  BackgroundColor #F0F8FF
  BorderColor #555555
}
skinparam ArrowColor #333333
skinparam nodesep 50
skinparam ranksep 60

' ===== Client tier (top) =====
node "Client tier" as ClientTier {
  node "Client 1\n(iOS App)" as C1
  node "Client 2\n(iOS App)" as C2
  node "Client 3\n(iOS App)" as C3
}

' ===== Local on-device persistence (side of client tier) =====
database "Local Storage\n(LocalTransactionRepository)" as Local
note right of Local
  Transactions are saved locally
  on the device. No cloud storage.
end note

C1 --> Local : save (JSON)
C2 --> Local : save (JSON)
C3 --> Local : save (JSON)

' ===== Web / proxy tier =====
node "Web Server\n(Local backend via ngrok)" as Web
note right of Web
  Backend runs locally on the
  developer machine and is exposed
  publicly via ngrok.
end note

C1 -down-> Web : HTTPS REST\n(JSON request / response)
C2 -down-> Web : HTTPS REST\n(JSON request / response)
C3 -down-> Web : HTTPS REST\n(JSON request / response)

' ===== API / application tier =====
component "API Provider Application Server\n(OAuth flow + import processing)" as API
component "Open Banking\nLogin (bank)" as Bank

Web -down-> API : Forward API request\n/ transactions
API -right-> Bank : OAuth flow /\nexchange access token

' ===== Data tier =====
database "Database Server\n(Transaction records)" as DB
note right of DB
  Data tier — accessible only
  by the API application server.
end note

API -down-> DB : Transactions /\nretrieve transactions

@enduml
